<BaseLayout title="Decoheron - Solutions-Focused Cyber Security & Director Liability Reduction">
<section class="dh-hero" aria-labelledby="dh-hero-title">
  <div class="dh-hero__inner">
    <div>
      <h1 class="dh-hero__title" id="dh-hero-title">
        <span>Security you can prove.</span>
        <span>No just promised.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="dh-hero__lede">
          Purpose-built for your Small and Medium-sized businesses in Legal, Accounting, and Wealth Management.
      </p>
      <p class="dh-hero__lede">
          Decoheron transforms the Microsoft security capabilities you already own into ASD-aligned, continuously verified security controls that reduce risk, simplify compliance, and provide evidence your obligations are being met.
      </p>
      <p class="dh-hero__lede">
        Unlike traditional security consulting, we don't deliver opinions, maturity scores, or best-effort recommendations.
      </p>
      <p class="dh-hero__lede">
        We deliver measurable security outcomes backed by ongoing attestation
      </p>
      
      <div class="dh-hero__actions">
        <a class="dh-btn dh-btn--primary" href="/liabilities">See your exposure</a>
        <a class="dh-btn dh-btn--secondary" href="/solution">See how the controls work</a>
      </div>
    </div>

