<section class="dh-facts" aria-label="Why this matters">
  <div class="dh-facts__inner">
    <div class="dh-fact">
      <p class="dh-fact__figure">72 hours</p>
      <p class="dh-fact__text">The window to report a ransomware payment under the Cyber Security Act 2024, for businesses with turnover above $3 million.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="dh-fact">
      <p class="dh-fact__figure">Duty of care</p>
      <p class="dh-fact__text">Sections 180 and 181 of the Corporations Act 2001 set the duty of care and diligence for directors and other officers.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="dh-fact">
      <p class="dh-fact__figure">8 of 8</p>
      <p class="dh-fact__text">ASD Essential Eight strategies tested and evidenced. A control either works or it doesn't.</p>
    </div>
